    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35994" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνουρ-έω</span></b> , aor. 1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεούρησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					45
				</span></i>
			:—<i>make water in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.138
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				2.172
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὰ ὦτα</span>”
