					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					3.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermipp.
					82.1
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐνεουρηκότες</span>
			like
			<i>piss-a-beds,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
